Package: claudeplot
Type: Package
Title: Anthropic and Claude Inspired 'ggplot2' Themes and Color Scales
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Vinicius", "Oike", email = "viniciusoike@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0005-8015-9189"))
Description: A 'ggplot2' extension that brings the visual language of
  Anthropic and Claude to R. Provides a publication-ready theme, qualitative,
  sequential, and diverging color palettes drawn from Anthropic's brand and
  data-visualization style, discrete and continuous color and fill scales, and
  palette display helpers. The package bundles Anthropic's recommended open
  typefaces ('Poppins' for headings and 'Lora' for body text) and registers
  them automatically when 'systemfonts' is available.
